* ADP7118 3.3V to 1.8V LDO
.lib ADP7102.lib

* Input Voltage Source
V1 IN 0 3.3

* Input and Output Decoupling Capacitors
C1 IN 0 2.2u
C2 OUT 0 2.2u

* 50 mA Resistive Load (1.8V / 50mA = 36 Ohms)
Rload OUT 0 36

* Feedback Resistor Divider
* ADP7118 Vref = 1.2V. Vout = Vref * (1 + R1/R2)
* For Vout = 1.8V: 1.8 = 1.2 * (1 + 5k/10k)
R1 OUT ADJ 5k
R2 ADJ 0 10k

* Soft-start Capacitor
Css SS 0 1n

* ADP7118 LDO Subcircuit Instance
* Pinout: VIN GND EN SS ADJ VOUT
X1 IN 0 IN SS ADJ OUT ADP7118

* Transient Analysis to allow output to settle
.tran 10m

.end
